[Trigger]
Name	briar
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Thornreach has walled itself in thorn, master, and the hedge maze in the middle is the only road between the five halls. Four keepers have made camps at the corners of the province and warden Cassia Thorne holds the court.
Action	objective	1	Destroy every rival keeper.
Action	objective	1	Dig and burn a path through the thorn maze.
Action	objective	1	Keep your heart alive while the keepers trade blows.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hedgeA
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hedge1
Action	message	1	Thorns grow thick on both sides. Dirt walls give way to the pick, but the black hedges do not.
Action	reveal	1	NorthWest
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hedgeB
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hedge2
Action	message	1	The south hedge hides a pit of molten rock. Mind your step.
